# Cyris schedule — supercronic fires at container-local clock (TZ set in compose).
#
# The tick is hourly and unconditional; `--if-due` asks the effective digest
# schedule (D1 `settings`, falling back to `cyris.toml [general]`) whether this
# hour is a digest hour, and derives --period from which of the two it is.
# A fixed `0 8,20` line could not do that: this file is baked into the image, so
# changing the times would mean a rebuild.
0 * * * * cyris run --if-due --config /app/cyris.toml --sources /app/sources.yaml
# promote-sync: hourly
0 * * * * cyris promote-sync --config /app/cyris.toml --sources /app/sources.yaml
